{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Park the car!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Valet parking in parking garages is not an easy job. You have to park the cars without a scratch in a quick and efficient manner. You have to avoid obstacles like cones, puddles, pot holes, oil slicks? and... gates? Wait...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Speed and Precision</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your boss requires you to park these cars in record time. Every scratch, every dink, every bump is taken away from you. All while the owner looks on... Oh and those cones also come out of your paycheck I'm sure...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Puzzle of Limitations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Valet Parking Not Included is a puzzle game about having limited controls and attempting to get the best times and score possible. How will you deal with each level, and how will you park the cars?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple types of cars to park.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60 levels and more to come.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All sound effects voiced by me!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More surprises to come post launch!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3708870?t=1748923225","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3708870?t=1748923225","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708870/4cdd03570cc182ea81a5653236b4c596f0cc2256/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748923225","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708870/4cdd03570cc182ea81a5653236b4c596f0cc2256/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748923225","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3722030,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Park the car!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Valet parking in parking garages is not an easy job. You have to park the cars without a scratch in a quick and efficient manner. You have to avoid obstacles like cones, puddles, pot holes, oil slicks? and... gates? Wait...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Speed and Precision</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your boss requires you to park these cars in record time. Every scratch, every dink, every bump is taken away from you. All while the owner looks on... Oh and those cones also come out of your paycheck I'm sure...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Puzzle of Limitations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Valet Parking Not Included is a puzzle game about having limited controls and attempting to get the best times and score possible. How will you deal with each level, and how will you park the cars?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple types of cars to park.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60 levels and more to come.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All sound effects voiced by me!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More surprises to come post launch!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Robots in Disguise"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708870/55fa25554f0dc5c20acc53ce71216750ff02f61b/header.jpg?t=1748923225","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3708870/883953/147d8bc31ff87c7d4cc61be0d2967d8ad7fe9dbb/1750427042/dash_av1.mpd?t=1746709029","dash_h264":"https://video.akam